    "splat": {},
    "biography": "<p>A slender, wiry man of middle height with brown skin and shock-white dreadlocks. He wears a yellow silken wrap (formerly embroidered with scriptures of the Unconquered Sun, now glorifying Cecelyne) and bracers of delicate green and gold metal on his shins and forearms. Born a bastard child in the Varang City-States, adopted by the Three Devils Gang, he Exalted as a Twilight Caste Solar when he took sanctuary in a shrine of the Unconquered Sun after the gang's destruction. Seduced by demons he summoned in his quest for vengeance and knowledge, he eventually turned akuma to Cecelyne. Now serves as the operator of the Last Supplicant of Endless Power (the Penitent statue at the Lap) for the Empress's forces.</p><p><strong>Motivation:</strong> Punish Creation. (Urge: Punish Creation. Limit Break: Deliberate Cruelty.)</p><h3>Attacks (reference — add weapon items for roll pipeline)</h3><p>Punch: Speed 5, Accuracy 6, Damage 3B, Parry DV 4, Rate 3, Tags N. Kick: Speed 5, Accuracy 5, Damage 6B, Parry DV 2, Rate 2, Tags N. Clinch: Speed 6, Accuracy 5, Damage 3B, Parry DV --, Rate 1, Tags C,N,P. Exceptional Short Sword: Speed 4, Accuracy 11, Damage 7L*, Parry DV 5, Rate 3. Fine Knife: Speed 5, Accuracy 10, Damage 5L*, Parry DV 4, Rate 3, Tags T. *Yozi Venom: Damage 10A/minute, Toxicity 5L, Tolerance --/--, Penalty -5.</p><h3>Powers</h3><p>Body-Mending Meditation, Dread Panoply of the Silent Wind, First Adorjan Excellency (x4), First Investigation Excellency, First Melee Excellency, Hungry Tiger Technique, Judge's Ear Technique, Ox-Body Technique (x2), Reflex Sidestep Technique, Sacred Kamilla's Inhalation, Second Dodge Excellency, Sorcerous Enlightenment of Adorjan (x2), Spirit-Cutting Attack, Spirit-Detecting Glance, Thousandfold Typhoon Hand, Wind-Born Stride. Combo: Three Devils Blade (First Melee Excellency, Thousandfold Typhoon Hand, Reflex Sidestep Technique, Second Dodge Excellency). Spells--Celestial Circle: Fiend-Vassal Conscription, Insidious Tendrils of Hate, Sapphire Countermagic, Shadows of the Ancient Past, Summoning the Heart of Darkness. Terrestrial Circle: Assassin's Fatal Touch, Corrupted Words, Emerald Circle Banishment, Empathic Wind, Flight of Separation, Private Plaza of Downcast Eyes, Slave-Spawn Summons. Thaumaturgy: Art of Enchantment: Initiate; Art of Geomancy: Master.</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Allies (Realm) 3, Artifact (Prosthetic of Clockwork Elegance) 2, Artifact (Discreet Essence Armor) 2, Backing (Cecelyne) 4, Demonic Inheritance 5, Demonic Patron (Jacint) 5, Manse 3, Savant 3</p><p><em>Original essence pool from source: Personal 18 / Peripheral 35 (43) / Committed 8 motes</em></p><p><em>Source: Return of the Scarlet Empress</em></p>",
